# Training Priorities

CAS modifies training emphasis according to sport.

Examples:

Boxing

Higher emphasis on rotational power, punching velocity and footwork.

---

Wrestling

Higher emphasis on maximal strength, grip strength and repeated explosive efforts.

---

Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu

Higher emphasis on grip endurance, isometric strength and movement efficiency.

---

Judo

Higher emphasis on explosive pulling, kuzushi and rotational power.

---

MMA

Balanced development across all capabilities.

---

Krav Maga

Priority given to reaction speed, acceleration, robustness and movement under uncertainty.

