# Decision Engine Implications

The Decision Engine uses this comparison to modify:

Capability priorities.

Exercise selection.

Training volume.

Training intensity.

Recovery requirements.

Progression models.

Exercise transfer scores.

Session generation.

Periodization.

Explainability.

No two sports receive identical programming.

---

# Individualization

Sport comparison is only one layer.

Programming also depends upon:

Age.

Sex.

Competitive level.

Training history.

Injury history.

Goals.

Recovery capacity.

Available equipment.

Individual characteristics always override generic sport characteristics.

